  "question": {
    "text": "If the function <math><mi>f</mi></math> given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math>, for some <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> is increasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and decreasing in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then a root of the equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is :",
